## Page Sections (in order)

### Navbar
- R icon logo (`/redux-logo.png`) — left, links to #home
- Nav links (smooth-scroll anchors): Home → #home, Features → #features, FAQ → #faq — center
- Discord button (outline style) — right
- Join Waitlist button (`BTN_PRIMARY_SOLID`) scrolls to #waitlist — right
- Sticky, gains backdrop-blur + bottom border on scroll
- Mobile: hamburger menu collapse

### Hero
- id="home"
- Headline: "Your AI agent for professional photo editing"
- Subheadline: "Organize, edit, and export photos—all from your browser"
- CTA button "Join Waitlist" scrolls to #waitlist
- Framer Motion stagger fade-in on load

### Showcase
- Read-only, scrollable mock of the Redux editor UI
- Browser frame with fake URL bar ("app.redux.photo") and window controls
- Inner layout: left sidebar (tool icons), center canvas (photo placeholder), right panel (sliders)
- Transparent overlay div blocks all clicks; parent div allows scroll
- Framer Motion whileInView fade-in

### Marquee Strip
- Label: "Inspired by workflows from"
- Scrolling items: Adobe Photoshop · Adobe Lightroom · Luminar Neo · Canva · Figma
- CSS keyframe animation (animate-marquee), pauses on hover
- Items duplicated for seamless loop

### Features
- id="features"
- Three cards, responsive grid (3-col desktop, 1-col mobile)
- Each card: image placeholder div (swap for real screenshot later), headline, description, ghost CTA button → #waitlist
- Feature 1: "Conversational Editing" — "Describe your edits..." — button: "Ask AI"
- Feature 2: "Style Match" — "Recreate any style instantly..." — button: "Match a Style"
- Feature 3: "Smart Search" — "Find any photo by describing its content..." — button: "Search Now"
- Framer Motion whileInView stagger on cards

### FAQ
- id="faq"
- Accordion, one item open at a time, useState openIndex
- Framer Motion AnimatePresence for height animation
- 6 questions (see .devnotes for full content)

### Waitlist Section
- id="waitlist"
- Headline: "Join the Waitlist"
- Subheadline: "Get early access when we launch, plus join our founding community today."
- Email input + "Join" button inline (stacked on mobile)
- Three states: idle → loading → success ("You're on the list!")
- Client-side email validation before POST to /api/waitlist

### Footer
- Left: logo, tagline, social icons (Instagram, LinkedIn, X, Discord)
- Right: two columns — Navigation (Home, Features, FAQ, Contact → mailto:hello@redux.photo) and Legal (Privacy Policy, Terms of Service → # for now)
- Bottom bar: "© Redux 2025. All rights reserved."

---

## API Route — /api/waitlist

Method: POST
Body: { email: string }
Validation: regex check server-side
Action: upsert into WaitlistEntry table via Prisma
Returns: { success: true } or { error: string }

Prisma model:
model WaitlistEntry {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  email     String   @unique
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

